<title>GREECE: AGRICULTURAL BANK OFFERS PERSONAL LOANS FOR OTE SHARES.</title>
<headline>AGRICULTURAL BANK OFFERS PERSONAL LOANS FOR OTE SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agricultural Bank said on Tuesday that personal loans up to 1.0 million drachmas will be available to clients who wish to subscribe for shares of OTE telecom.</p>
<p>Allotments of OTE shares will be held as collateral for the loan. The facility will be available throughout Agricultural Bank's branch network.</p>
<p>The loans mature in one year.</p>
<p>Subscriptions for OTE's public offering will take place during June 11-13. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
